sequenceDiagram
  participant L as team lead
  participant BI as teammate inbox
  participant W as teammate
  participant LI as leader inbox
  L->>BI: shutdown_request(requestId)
  W->>BI: read request
  alt approve
    W->>LI: shutdown_approved(requestId)
    W->>W: abort own controller / graceful exit
  else reject
    W->>LI: shutdown_rejected(requestId, reason)
    W->>W: continue working
  end
